<https://0k.computer/ontology#presentedOn> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://0k.computer/ontology#Concept> .
<https://0k.computer/ontology#presentedOn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The specific surface on which a signifier is presented — a keybinding on an input surface, a button on a graphical one." .
