<https://0k.computer/ontology#presentsSignifier> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://0k.computer/ontology#presentsSignifier> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://0k.computer/ontology#Concept> .
<https://0k.computer/ontology#presentsSignifier> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A decision (a design, or a publication) declares that a signifier is presented as part of its experience contract." .
